+# Research
+- Decision: unescape `~1` before `~0` (RFC 6901 §4) — done in one regex pass `~([01])`, validating stray `~` beforehand.
+- Decision: `Object.hasOwn` for objects to avoid prototype members (`__proto__`, `constructor`). Alternative `in` rejected: leaks inherited names.
+- Decision: array index regex `^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$`; `-` always throws since it designates a nonexistent element.
+- Decision: URI fragment form out of scope.
